  "question": "If $f(x)=5^x$, find $f'(x)$ and hence evaluate $f'(0)$.",
  "answeroption": "D",
  "explanation": "<b>Derivative of the exponential function</b><br>Using $$\\frac{d}{dx}(a^x)=a^x\\log a,$$ we obtain $$f'(x)=5^x\\log 5.$$<br><b>Evaluation at $x=0$</b><br>$$f'(0)=5^0\\log 5=\\log 5.$$<br>Hence, $$f'(0)=\\log 5.$$",
  "explanation_image": [],
  "options": {
