    "B": "$f'(x)=5^x$ and $f'(0)=1$",
    "C": "$f'(x)=5^x\\log x$ and $f'(0)=0$",
    "D": "$f'(x)=5^x\\log 5$ and $f'(0)=\\log 5$"
